  "equations": [
    {
      "id": "particle-gravity",
      "name": {
        "ja": "重力粒子モデル",
        "en": "Gravitational particle model"
      },
      "formula": [
        "\\boldsymbol a_i=-G\\sum_{j\\ne i}m_j\\frac{\\boldsymbol x_i-\\boldsymbol x_j}{(|\\boldsymbol x_i-\\boldsymbol x_j|^2+\\epsilon^2)^{3/2}}",
        "\\nabla^2\\phi=4\\pi G(\\rho-\\overline\\rho)\\quad\\text{(periodic)}"
      ],
      "note": {
        "ja": "孤立系のPlummer軟化力と、周期・平均密度除去のPoisson式は異なる境界問題です。公開例は静的な力と境界核の検証で、自己重力流体の時間発展ではありません。",
        "en": "Isolated Plummer-softened forces and periodic mean-subtracted Poisson are distinct boundary problems. Public examples check static forces and kernels, not coupled self-gravitating flow evolution."
      },
      "url": {
        "ja": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/equations/?lang=ja#particle-gravity-ja",
        "en": "https://hrkoyama.github.io/numerical-methods-atlas/equations/?lang=en#particle-gravity-en"
      }
    }
  ],
  "equation_note": {
    "ja": "G=M=a1,e.4,masses.6/.4、epsilon0、128/256/512steps、初期COM/P0。",
    "en": "G=M=a1,e.4,masses.6/.4,epsilon0,128/256/512steps,initialCOM/P0."
  },
